pending money for lunch or souvenirs.\n\n💧 Includes:\nRound-trip transportation from San Diego, professional bilingual guide, visits to Santa Monica, Beverly Hills, Hollywood & Downtown LA, and bottled water.\n\n🍽️ Not Included:\nMeals, beverages, and gratuities.\n\n⚠️ Please note:\n\nThis is a full-day tour (approx. 12 hours).\n\nTraffic in Los Angeles may affect return time slightly.\n\nIf you need to cancel or reschedule, please contact us at least 24 hours in advance.\n\n📞 Questions?\nCall or WhatsApp us at +1 (619) 869-5188 or email support@fivestartours.com\n.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you aboard for a Five Star experience to Hollywood and Los Angeles! 🎬", "cancellation_notes": "All bookings are final — no refunds will be issued once your reservation is confirmed.\n\nIn rare cases where unforeseen conditions such as weather, traffic, or border delays prevent the tour from operating, we will notify you as soon as possible and provide a full refund to your original method of payment.\n\nPlease note:\n\nIf you fail to arrive on time, or miss your departure, no refund will be provided.\n\nChanges to your booking are subject to availability and must be requested at least 24 hours before the tour.\n\nFive Star Tours reserves the right to modify or cancel any tour due to circumstances beyond our control.\n\nThank you for your understanding and cooperation!", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Ready to See the Stars?", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/fivestartours/items/680237/images/1613052/", "pk": 1613052, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/AyUwrAEsQAmrWU3pFqA9", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/AyUwrAEsQAmrWU3pFqA9", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/fivestartours/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/fivestartours/items/6